  "captions": [
    {"start": 0.481, "end": 2.001, "lines": ["You've picked some hypotheticals that"]},
    {"start": 2.001, "end": 3.361, "lines": ["are particularly helpful for you."]},
    {"start": 3.361, "end": 4.321, "lines": ["Chick-fil-A, you don't"]},
    {"start": 4.321, "end": 8.001, "lines": ["think of that if it's anything other than","chicken. But there are a lot of stores"]},
    {"start": 8.001, "end": 10.561, "lines": ["that sell a lot of different things,"]},
    {"start": 10.561, "end": 14.961, "lines": ["including the type","of videos that we're talking about."]},
    {"start": 14.961, "end": 18.481, "lines": ["And so I don't know why","we should focus just on the easy"]},
    {"start": 18.481, "end": 21.441, "lines": ["hypotheticals.","Well, it's sort of my job to focus"]},
    {"start": 21.441, "end": 24.4, "lines": ["on the easy hypotheticals.","But I think if you I would think"]},
    {"start": 24.4, "end": 25.44, "lines": ["your job is to focus"]},
    {"start": 25.44, "end": 29.68, "lines": ["on the hard ones. At least","my job is to direct your attention to the"]},
    {"start": 29.68, "end": 31.28, "lines": ["easy hypotheticals, I would suppose."]},
    {"start": 31.28, "end": 34.4, "lines": ["But fair enough, your job is to direct","to the harder hypotheticals."]},
    {"start": 34.4, "end": 37.44, "lines": ["But I'm not sure there really","are that many hard hypotheticals in"]},
    {"start": 37.44, "end": 42.12, "lines": ["the sense that we're not taking","the position that if you do actually"]},
    {"start": 42.56, "end": 46.4, "lines": ["are in the business,","you are a videotape service provider,"]},
    {"start": 46.4, "end": 48.4, "lines": ["that Because you do lots"]},
    {"start": 48.4, "end": 52.16, "lines": ["of other things or the rest, that you're","not covered. And we think, I mean,"]},
    {"start": 52.16, "end": 53.68, "lines": ["you know, I think we would take"]},
    {"start": 53.68, "end": 56.56, "lines": ["the position, though I think","Justice Thomas raises a good"]},
    {"start": 56.56, "end": 58.32, "lines": ["question about streaming services,"]},
    {"start": 58.32, "end": 61.04, "lines": ["but we would take","the position that Netflix,"]},
    {"start": 61.04, "end": 64.4, "lines": ["when you go online to Netflix,","that that might still be covered."]},
    {"start": 64.4, "end": 68.72, "lines": ["So I think the core of the statute","is still covered under our view."]},
    {"start": 68.72, "end": 72.28, "lines": ["But what I think what","we would say is that this notion"]},
    {"start": 72.656, "end": 73.936, "lines": ["That you can just"]},
    {"start": 73.936, "end": 78.256, "lines": ["mix and match what makes you a consumer","and what gives you the personally"]},
    {"start": 78.256, "end": 82.576, "lines": ["identifiable information","that the statute protects for consumers."]},
    {"start": 82.576, "end": 84.576, "lines": ["That mismatch doesn't make any sense."]},
    {"start": 84.576, "end": 86.176, "lines": ["It's dog mixing and matching."]},
    {"start": 86.176, "end": 89.296, "lines": ["It's following the definitions","where they lead."]},
    {"start": 89.296, "end": 92.016, "lines": ["So this definition says goods","and services."]},
    {"start": 92.016, "end": 94.976, "lines": ["It doesn't say audiovisual goods","and services."]},
    {"start": 94.976, "end": 99.376, "lines": ["Other definitions do have the modifier","in them. That suggests that the fact"]},
    {"start": 99.376, "end": 102.608, "lines": ["that this definition","does not have the modifier in it."]},
    {"start": 102.608, "end": 104.368, "lines": ["is especially important."]},
    {"start": 104.368, "end": 108.048, "lines": ["And you can't get the modifier","from the FROM clause"]},
    {"start": 108.048, "end": 111.968, "lines": ["because the FROM clause just tells","you where you're getting the goods"]},
    {"start": 111.968, "end": 116.048, "lines": ["and services from, but the goods","and services are the goods and services"]},
    {"start": 116.048, "end": 118.208, "lines": ["not modified in any other way."]},
    {"start": 118.208, "end": 122.448, "lines": ["So mixing and matching,","there are three different definitions."]},
    {"start": 122.448, "end": 124.448, "lines": ["You have to put them together."]},
    {"start": 124.448, "end": 129.168, "lines": ["What you get, most naturally read,","is the petitioner's understanding of the"]},
    {"start": 129.168, "end": 132.704, "lines": ["statute. Well, two things, Your Honor.","I mean, one, you know, sometimes"]},
    {"start": 132.704, "end": 135.76, "lines": ["when that's what you get,","maybe you should take another look."]},
    {"start": 135.76, "end": 139.28, "lines": ["And the premise of your question,","of course, is that from a videotape"]},
    {"start": 139.28, "end": 142.24, "lines": ["service provider isn't","doing any definitional"]},
    {"start": 142.24, "end": 146, "lines": ["work in the definition of consumer.","And I would just take issue with that."]},
    {"start": 146, "end": 148.8, "lines": ["I mean, you know,","from a videotape service provider,"]},
    {"start": 148.8, "end": 152.48, "lines": ["videotape service provider","is a defined term in the statute."]},
    {"start": 152.48, "end": 156.8, "lines": ["If you plug that definition","into the statute, then what you get"]},
    {"start": 156.8, "end": 161.44, "lines": ["is consumer means any renter, purchaser,","or subscriber of goods or services"]},
    {"start": 161.44, "end": 165.664, "lines": ["from any person engaged in the business","in or affecting interstate or foreign"]},
    {"start": 165.664, "end": 168.304, "lines": ["Commerce of rental, sale, or delivery"]},
    {"start": 168.304, "end": 173.184, "lines": ["of pre-recorded video cassette tapes","or similar audiovisual materials."]},
    {"start": 173.184, "end": 174.544, "lines": ["After I'm done plugging"]},
    {"start": 174.544, "end": 177.904, "lines": ["that into the statute, I'm left","with the conclusion that the goods"]},
    {"start": 177.904, "end": 182.624, "lines": ["or service we're talking about here","are pre-recorded video cassette tapes"]},
    {"start": 182.624, "end": 186.624, "lines": ["or similar audiovisual materials. But they","don't have to be, Mr. But that, but they"]},
    {"start": 186.624, "end": 189.264, "lines": ["don't have to be.","I mean, we talked about hypotheticals."]},
    {"start": 189.264, "end": 193.104, "lines": ["Let me give you what I hope is a hard","hypothetical that you can address."]},
    {"start": 193.104, "end": 194.104, "lines": ["So, suppose."]},
    {"start": 194.464, "end": 198.944, "lines": ["We had Justice Breyer,","he was mentioned before,"]},
    {"start": 198.944, "end": 201.024, "lines": ["entering a video store."]},
    {"start": 201.024, "end": 206.544, "lines": ["And the store not only rents and sells","videos, but also books about films."]},
    {"start": 206.544, "end": 209.744, "lines": ["And Justice Breyer is particularly","interested in foreign films."]},
    {"start": 209.744, "end": 211.356, "lines": ["So he buys a book."]}
